[SPEAKER_00]: see. You know, it was just about opening our eyes and knowing what was possible and being prepared to give it a go. And how was it to do that?

12:19.565 --> 12:32.009
[SPEAKER_00]: Yeah, it was brave. Brave and foolish or, you know, it was just exciting. I've done it, you know, I've done it as a pioneer pilot. but I've always

