17:08.888 --> 17:23.357
[SPEAKER_00]: flying day there. But then by... By the end of October, it was getting too stable to get above about 2,800 meters. But my experience is that

17:23.417 --> 17:34.340
[SPEAKER_00]: everything has stepped back. And in fact, the monsoon hasn't properly gone away until the first week or so of October. And actually, it's

17:34.421 --> 17:45.467
[SPEAKER_00]: unstable enough to get up well over 3,000 meters right the way into November now. Indeed. You know, I left this year, I left on about the 15th

17:45.507 --> 17:56.496
