18:19.609 --> 18:27.951
[SPEAKER_01]: here, which also brings us to a point that it's even more important to think about climate change and how we are having an impact on the planet

18:28.571 --> 18:35.133
[SPEAKER_01]: as a whole. Yeah, there seems to be an effect of climate change, definitely. I think the inversions are thicker and blacker than they

18:35.193 --> 18:48.655
